        "updated_at": "2022-05-20T15:29:30Z",
        "closed_at": null,
        "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
        "active_lock_reason": null,
        "body": "Hi!\r\n\r\nI've been trying to use endanger on our projects on Bitbucket, but it seems like there is an extra \\n or new line at the end of every message, even if there wasn't any on the  as can be seen on the image below.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/51753940/149219622-0066ad0b-75fd-434d-b305-3deb3ebf1792.png)\r\n\r\nIs there a way to remove those trailing new lines?\r\n\r\nsource code:\r\n\r\n```\r\n...\r\n      messages: {\r\n            missingPrefix: \"{where} não está marcado com um prefixo válido. Deve iniciar com 'bugfix/', 'feature/' ou 'hotfix/'.\",\r\n            prefixThanks: \":thumbsup: Obrigado por colocar o prefixo correto no título da {where}.\",\r\n            hasCard: \":thumbsup: {where} contém um card do Jira\",\r\n            doesntHaveCard: `{where} não contém um card do Jira no formato '<prefix>-<number>'. Exemplo: 'CA-123'`,\r\n        },\r\n...\r\n                    context.message(\"prefixThanks\", {}, {where: where})\r\n...\r\n```",
